#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:3
msgid "FourWheelsCollisionAvoidance"
msgstr "FourWheelsCollisionAvoidance"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:7
msgid "Role of the class"
msgstr "Rôle de la classe"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:9
msgid ""
"The ``FourWheelsCollisionAvoidance`` class is the main class of the "
"Webots controller. It is the entry point of the program. Webots launches "
"this class when the robot uses the ``FourWheelsCollisionAvoidance`` "
"controller."
msgstr ""
"La classe ``FourWheelsCollisionAvoidance`` est la classe principale du "
"contrôleur Webots. C'est le point d'entrée du programme. Webots lance "
"cette classe lorsque le robot utilise le contrôleur "
"``FourWheelsCollisionAvoidance``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:13
msgid ""
"Its role is intentionally limited. It does not contain the complete robot"
" logic. It simply creates a ``Supervisor`` object, then creates a "
"``TERBot`` object and calls its ``run()`` method."
msgstr ""
"Son rôle est volontairement limité. Elle ne contient pas la logique "
"complète du robot. Elle crée simplement un objet ``Supervisor``, puis "
"crée un objet ``TERBot`` et lance sa méthode ``run()``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:19
msgid "Responsibilities"
msgstr "Responsabilités"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:21
msgid "Start the Webots controller."
msgstr "Démarrer le contrôleur Webots."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:22
msgid "Create the ``Supervisor`` object."
msgstr "Créer l'objet ``Supervisor``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:23
msgid "Create the main ``TERBot`` object."
msgstr "Créer l'objet principal ``TERBot``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:24
msgid "Start the main robot loop with ``run()``."
msgstr "Lancer la boucle principale du robot avec ``run()``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:28
msgid "Encapsulation"
msgstr "Encapsulation"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:30
msgid ""
"This class contains almost no internal state. It only serves as an entry "
"point."
msgstr ""
"Cette classe ne contient presque pas d'état interne. Elle sert uniquement "
"de point d'entrée."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:33
msgid ""
"The robot logic is delegated to the ``TERBot`` class. This avoids having "
"a main file that is too long and difficult to maintain."
msgstr ""
"La logique du robot est déléguée à la classe ``TERBot``. Cela évite "
"d'avoir un fichier principal trop long et difficile à maintenir."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:38
msgid "Relations with other classes"
msgstr "Relations avec les autres classes"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:40
msgid ""
"``FourWheelsCollisionAvoidance`` depends on ``Supervisor``, provided by "
"the Webots API, and on ``TERBot``, which contains the main robot logic."
msgstr ""
"``FourWheelsCollisionAvoidance`` dépend de ``Supervisor``, fourni par "
"l'API Webots, et de ``TERBot``, qui contient la logique principale du "
"robot."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:43
msgid ""
"This is a creation relationship: the main class creates an instance of "
"``TERBot``."
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'une relation de création : la classe principale crée une "
"instance de ``TERBot``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:48
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Fonctions"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:51
msgid "``main(String[] args)``"
msgstr "``main(String[] args)``"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:53
msgid ""
"Entry point of the Java program. This method is automatically called when"
" the controller is launched by Webots."
msgstr ""
"Point d'entrée du programme Java. Cette méthode est appelée "
"automatiquement au lancement du contrôleur par Webots."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:56
msgid "It performs the following actions:"
msgstr "Elle effectue les actions suivantes :"

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:58
msgid "Create a ``Supervisor`` object."
msgstr "Création d'un objet ``Supervisor``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:59
msgid "Create a ``TERBot`` object."
msgstr "Création d'un objet ``TERBot``."

#: ../../source/robot/controller/four_wheels_collision_avoidance.rst:60
msgid "Call the robot ``run()`` method."
msgstr "Appel de la méthode ``run()`` du robot."

